-Sodarex-vgtq/Vodka-Sodarex-vgtq-facebookJumbo.jpg", "alt": "", "primary": true}], "rating": {"average": 5.0, "count": 153}, "video_url": null, "comment_count": null, "published_at": "2012-05-13", "scraped_at": "2026-09-07T03:05:48.738827+00:00", "scraper_version": "1.0.0"}
